 said it was made by the halflings during the Age of Pyre as a weapon against the orcs. Even though it was destroyed, it managed to deal a crippling blow by killing their leader, Garkul the Devourer.","source_tag":"_t","target":"那只传奇傀儡——阿塔玛森的一只眼睛。据说它是半身人在烈火纪为了对抗兽人所造的武器。虽然它被破坏了，但是它也成功地使对方的首领吞噬者加库尔走向死亡。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6b292c30ec352c4f5eb0128003879f686c4e670dfbd1c87ec9b5d97cc5bc67c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c8783099bee93baf9d90a8fc1a6961ee05ff1733c2af1a1af2705992b45669f","logical_entry_identity":"e994bca6b87e507de2645f970a09c4b4d78ba1d55f0ccdb5e70bc480eaa8cab2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Redfur Hair 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"红发1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a843c78b26b01b04f0bcab4e8579a6fc254c5553032f45a70fd0d21b65111360","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c8953689e339b7339c516e19561984ab664eec9976532dc9d0bb11376666c36","logical_entry_identity":"e6aab66f2eacf24829f6099b709f41040f43ecad00221b08c1404618651e6d72","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You absorb latent cold around you, turning into an ice elemental - a shivgoroth - for %d turns.\n\t\tWhile transformed, you do not need to breathe, gain access to the Ice Storm talent at level %d, gain %d%% resistance to cuts and stuns, gain %d%% cold resistance, and all cold damage heals you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe power will increase with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#Ice storm:#LAST#\n\t\t%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你吸收周围的寒冰围绕你，将自己转变为纯粹的冰元素——西弗格罗斯，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t转化成元素后，你不需要呼吸并获得等级 %d 的冰雪风暴，获得 %d%% 震慑和流血抵抗，%d%% 寒冷伤害抗性。所有寒冷伤害可对你产生治疗，治疗量基于伤害值的 %d%%。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#冰雪风暴：#LAST#\n\t\t%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee6162bc912cc701543a147110adb5eda41d07e791debe67e67c7c83615fcaaa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3c896e491d761a16378d3ace521fb677f9d462066480add18720a7a11c01d983","logical_entry_identity":"8de18f24ea0cade85cf33337982538dedeb0a49a3bccdb8c2545fda22d00ac99","norma