fingers look great!","source_tag":"_t","target":"戒指让你的手指更加美丽！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cfe65382b3a792ff324637d0679d433ebc3a7c5f8f3b9fd680a6aaf9a79cc863","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ce35de8a6f659ddb59e17e6be8ff390cebb64c087773b57a66c4b3b8b75f6f7","logical_entry_identity":"a61d7ea9c0cbd5bb26b0f883e8e76c65d05ed1583b840942bca118d2c5c7fc3c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Before you stands a tall figure -- a very tall figure, propped high by a thick serpent's tail in place of where his legs should rightly be. His torso is human-like, with bulging muscles beneath fitted armour, and large hands gripping a fiercely sharp trident. He glares at you with dark intensity, like a wolf about to pounce on unsuspecting prey.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你面前站着一个高大的人影——一个非常高的人形怪物，在腿部长着巨大的蛇尾巴，他以此来支撑他的身体。他的上半身是人形，护甲下面隐约可见发达的肌肉，两只巨大的双手紧握着锋利的三叉戟。他带着阴沉的锐利目光盯着你，像一头随时准备扑向毫无防备猎物的狼。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b1e92acda52899572979d3b0de769e91fc41a372707a4812d2402d6316598f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ce5f8543e06af1133d9102bbe08abff29a079c4969a9d19400335920460c3f9","logical_entry_identity":"cf6f874fc2558f60ee67a3975c695acf3fb2a16dd29818f4e2b4353362848b04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Give Sher'tul fortress energy","source_tag":"_t","target":"获得夏·图尔堡垒能量"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b79e954e75a2af1243327602963bcf763cb5ba2405ac60a394e61005a1ba8b8b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ce78ab073aa9c5905e3c01c24bcf0b2bfe0c62f78bb9acd92e012f4be7ab2eb","logical_entry_identity":"2010a3b418cbb1f46829b67fbbcbf594c3a9dd6e07cc9738dea56ebdc206fef2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are not able to Disengage in that direction.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能朝这个方向后跳。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb292283e218a4206b04cda1e4bd6ee4fd4fcc9b920d44b2c73a683f1787c5db","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ce9cb216adc1e2942c844bdace9894ca47cb317805ef2a45859717879737988","logical_entry_identity":"cbafe6d78dadc75687b73105974798c265bc236d9fb9774f6ac28dc88819764b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Exterminate every foe on the level.","source_tag":"_t","target":"杀死这一层的所有敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"177d14fc9e2e4b0d0c237454676dea765339e145f45c8021d1f863baae7e7953","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3cec58bc3c580cbaac7a1dd462f581694be710df9be0259e956c8184bb190950","logical_entry_identity":"ca0b94a493991a75735c06a894374081199906045996e804eff215c64c559efa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Toss out a grappling hook to a target within range %d.  If this strikes either a wall or a creature that is immovable or larger than you, you will pull yourself towards it, otherwise, you will drag the target towards you.  Creatures struck by the hook will be pinned for 2 turns.\n\t\tYour grapple target must be at least 2 tiles from you.\n#YELLOW#Prepared with: %s#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"朝 %d 格范围内的目标发射钩爪，如果目标是墙壁、目标不能移动或目标体型比你大，你将被拉过去，否则将目标拉过来。之后，目标将被定身 2 回合。\n\t\t钩爪至少要发射到两格外。\n#YELLOW#装备于：%s#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ad5e345c01f3d0870f0139452d0de21a2f77433caf4a7aee989abebffdffc9ed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ceeb8768fc8210d2a68ab21a688757fcd85f5a9ff6abb09340193d9c16a7646","logical_entry_identity":"17e798cd130eb7ea3053f8ed07d43d73c6979d32cd041e95d7e1a6c04b0908cc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have seen the Queen in glory true\nAnd she has moved me to my soul\nOh Queen! Let me be a part of you!\nPlease devour me! Swallow me whole!!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我见到了女王真正的荣光\n她令我的灵魂为之震颤\n啊，女王！让我成为你的一部分吧！\n请吞噬我！把我整个吞下吧！！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8cb5313384eeffdfeaaa8dd2259d1197a065cafa53ea31012ecbff25288c0b96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3cf3bcacc7a967237d2a8a263915362300b65244cb69996bf984f42762f597bb","logical_entry_identity":"2f5cdc1509e64eef820e921804a0e556e3a52e65a2af9853e332d1b4db6b9c48","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"daikara","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"岱卡拉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c2e163dc8eefb238fdfcdeb6dfcb6da0675d6470dddfabf68c3edba5a432bf13","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d006a4c8c5cef8123f7f6f724679c1a9ba7ed8aa4a3b514bf02b02c2badb63b","logical_entry_identity":"48e71083b1c7b65364869194791ff42ca7adb7ab66a9009a2201eec8e2cadcf6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Permadeath: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"死亡模式："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a6a3879e2a374cd8fb7eac1e44c3cb5127494eed102cd1f0920b25f61baac4fa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d08062eef3082aa81762c72dcc70ca6bfd4d43e7fdeadd9372f4dafcfd8b32c","logical_entry_identity":"e5577fecf148c7957f37df906656192fe12aa3d9d5c134733f0e3fd4d87e4528","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"My masterpiece walks! It is glorious, beautiful. While it remains unfinished, it is finished enough to serve in its purpose of protecting my lair. No would-be hero will be able to defeat it, and once it is complete it will be nigh invulnerable! Now all that remains is to animate my newest minion and bend it to my will... then they'll see. They'll ALL see. What can possibly stop me now, I ask? What?!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我的杰作走起来了！它壮丽而美妙。虽然尚未彻底完成，却已经足以履行守卫我巢穴的使命。没有哪个自诩英雄的人能够击败它；等到它完全完成，更将近乎无敌！现在只剩唤醒我最新的仆从、使其屈从于我的意志……到时他们就会明白。他们全都会明白。我倒要问，如今还有什么能阻止我？什么？！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"edf05a5d446cc734aea321c3ad9b464520a3e9a025554b673e974ca566ce6dcf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d0b9767c0f88644ca5a5e03146bae56ccff79fb87d375f7c52ee938b977d355","logical_entry_identity":"ba31f580ca2433a4190045f5b32a5894558b431e0ae9df85f4ecb53920d94ed4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It's white and it's oozing.","source_tag":"_t","target":"又白又粘的软泥怪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"121b1044c0bae7d4cb56241822bebb6d09d1ae7fa04dcfc535e45b7a6cf4969d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d0b9e2ece2afa481d3a22cb2f7726cc36b6afb83ec77c8ca249a63833734a2c","logical_entry_identity":"3e04de044e63d1e8db41bfe698b6bd6d2908d1e016b58bda54e28827d6cff703","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the darkness!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了黑暗！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"23f57f6becaaa43636d3b6278865edae8f5a1dfd75dfecb77f17e70542ab4af2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d0bbb768307687391069b4a9833cee3f3996ee938e91692e378ab7ecbddee35","logical_entry_identity":"2bc3d8552e7495b47b38e3ed40ee8102befda7da675b666d15b482ba6160f348","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A Human hailing from the northern town of Derth. A common kind of man, unremarkable in all respects.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位来自北方小镇德斯的人类。一种随处可见的普通人，各方面都毫无特点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8807061a70fc5d800af9e6311ecb16b20e6b873a187dc0babf253e34e8c26fc7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d0ec5d1371e8ef9c0671ec626aa4b2063266aeeddad960400997ae06bd7a2c1","logical_entry_identity":"5d2be5e485ced0f99686e89c0e54b024e3a5af07d0c524b2b06b03d6c1d3a9f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lore","source_tag":"_t","target":"手札"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f2560f562e9debb0da1793c0617bc3fe793a9b725814f165d458c13d31c4f7d2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d11300603aca2688687bed62772cae3217e2dddc318683c58e3ef3ff3f403cb","logical_entry_identity":"af13b9c587098b8644cc68c967e2e8dfb170fdf7f039a806d3800d2f770b4fbd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This thick robe is woven from a dark green moss, firmly bound and cool to the touch. It is said to have rejuvenating properties.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件厚厚的长袍使用一大块深绿的苔藓织成的，十分牢固，摸上去很清凉。据说，它能让人恢复青春。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1114eac79e6b8cb471a6e7cd76af1decba6c0841842d34cafedcf42225ee5cb5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d137d04f9e5ab43b2c80b682ebed4c55be4e779623347046f9d6ef38152e6e7","logical_entry_identity":"7704d4ea4f58301a2d9ccdcbdbd2e3e9fead848a3e7fc27f972d6c599b48cb13","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You swap locations with a random target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你和一个随机目标交换位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58efe80c157f584c149c385c96565f6072e75ef2b33556f8444c1e7976f5dcf9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d139762a4b9e6f7ee3b4a72e8c34e39d89aacfaaf5a4a651555b46e22eae0a5","logical_entry_identity":"b8432df18615167970196dc2c3c1d988d75802c374e2eca301a8169a161456a9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"log of healer Astelrid","source_tag":"entity name","target":"治疗师亚斯特莉的日志"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"daa224f2e28c8c14ddd22c03469b97d1ab7ecaec830963b518438cfae8bb9f76","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d158c8a7601deac75e010082e18575935f5abd5dbc9520f07bf75b8177a2b83","logical_entry_identity":"3dda025e3fa540e48e5d1141706e655a64b5c279e02769d8b8edcacfd3a0e065","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"During your adventures you will find items.\nEach item has a weight. How much you can carry depends on your Strength: this is your maximum encumbrance.\nTo pickup an item, press 'g' or right click on yourself and choose 'Pickup item' while standing over it.\nTo view your inventory, press 'i' or right-click on yourself and choose 'Inventory'.\n\nYour inventory is split in two panels: your equipped items and your backpack.\nTo select an item, use the movement keys and press enter, click it with the mouse, or press the key next to its name.\n\nThe item you've found is an infusion. Infusions and runes allow you to bind a power to your body, gaining new abilities.\nInfusions come from the powers of nature while runes use magic and have unlimited uses once inscribed.\nThis infusion inscribes you with the power to regenerate your life at will. You can only have a finite number of inscriptions, but they can easily be replaced.\n\nNow move on to the west.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你的冒险过程中你会获得各种各样的物品。\n每一件物品都有重量。你能携带多少物品取决于你的力量属性：你有一个最大负重上限。\n按下 'g'键来拾取物品，或者当你的人物站在物品上时右键点击你自己并选择拾取物品。\n要查看物品栏，按下 'i'键或者右键点击自己选择物品栏。\n\n你的物品栏被分成两个部分：你装备的物品和背包中的物品。\n选择物品，可以用移动键来选择再按Enter来确认，或者直接鼠标左键单击即可，也可以\n直接按物品名字旁边的快捷键。\n\n你发现的物品是一个纹身，纹身和符文可以将一种能力印刻到你的身上，获得新的技能。\n纹身源于自然之力；符文则使用魔法，刻印后可以无限次使用。\n这个纹身的功能是能使你在你需要的时候回复生命值。你只能印刻有限数量的刻印，但\n你可以轻松地替换它们。\n\n现在继续向西前进。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a93c33bea529338fe3bc27dbab44521ae68a13240db1784ceb63ee29fb0b5c1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d1a9125d15fab1707d76ba2da21dd4e6c9a18ba7ac5d27121758ec2796bf278","logical_entry_identity":"9e1add06019405820864bd0cefd5283b0d48268585161b3e533452f2872c6b40","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"carefully avoid","source_tag":"_t","target":"小心避开了"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2df8a9c566d0fdd2635e85226065b20485db204d64900db07244b996c16a1228","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d22aa5d08897b76c107ba7eeaef935eae78765449a22269d4892620b0022098","logical_entry_identity":"e612c8997d0bb7a1e00c9abbb7418a36bef19e9f3d99d6824728227b677e6c63","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the temporal shear!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 抵挡了灵刃切变！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"458b3a4b493015db8f2c77303bf45c91276f5b472a91c4734aefc67b5ba45dfe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d28005efb0402d976bd2d6c90bb73c0583ae7bc57884059cd6efdfc48c80e7c","logical_entry_identity":"913bbd8865831a314f02b859e3a4ca8b25a512052de1bc3ecfc8bafb4bad1499","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\nBy the way, ","source_tag":"_t","target":"\n顺带一提，"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a3ea0b43bef699485d8d77ef24c625d8e6500d9827d2abfb8fb9b3a7f788383d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d2857d1676f4cb708994f3a8155027366402d2574cdf792ba0cd4052d0c2484","logical_entry_identity":"4d0efbbe84160d764597b179f80e27b9efd73ffec66752d7cb92ee3ad85a1eab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" range: ","source_tag":"_t","target":" 范围："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9154241a931ddef43a9fac2c225ac0f71819a5a559ab547671c25a3b79ec7b1f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identi