 can split into two for %d turns.\n\t\tYour original self has the original ooze aspect while your mitosis gains the acid aspect.\n\t\tIf you know the Oozing Blades tree all the talents inside are exchanged for those of the Corrosive Blades tree.\n\t\tYour two selves share the same healthpool.\n\t\tWhile you are split both of you gain %d%% all resistances.\n\t\tResistances will increase with Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的身体变的像软泥怪一样，你可以分裂成2个，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t你的本体获得原始的软泥特性，而分裂体则获得酸性特性。\n\t\t如果你习得软泥之刃系技能树，则该技能树会变为腐蚀之刃技能树。\n\t\t你和分裂体共享生命。\n\t\t当你分裂时，你增加 %d%% 所有抵抗。\n\t\t抵抗受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41b63b60b911d8da02618d408f51d6e22139aacf8f06e73996fd227f64965a56","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d38143df9e99c2e3496772fc8cea3ba8e9ac74df88693db3f258a366459dc1f","logical_entry_identity":"1a5f7682715181ef8264d14d8a46a182c2796e13e5b4650b15e5d05acf110f82","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s is purged of diseases!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 除去了疾病！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dd6bc814e4086bf8ac47a9b4256788d5463ecbfc748a3eafab614c05f9e2ecc3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d3990f4cf85a1a69ee6f0cd48c4d2cea19a68758e5bf1cbf1ed98fc14a97202","logical_entry_identity":"27d0f22a5c4fb9150a961d147dfe86ae86e03092bfc7432beb183d840bb7c61f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All that glitters is not gold; all that is gold does not glitter.","source_tag":"_t","target":"发光的不都是金子，金子不都是发光的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c59d0b84b69d6c265e3c39c8c8b02db4355a46526a5a2ed6fb624ebb2fbfde63","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3d3b10576c015b9275397d17ff703df12deee18cb8ceba269627378b2396249f","logical_entry_identity":"1bf0c8049a52f557a4472e4192bb3fde3e7b3b6e900eea93803434205fdf87dc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lead on; I will protect you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"带路吧，我会保护你的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f0401003199e61497f7d0c37985043771119cf4a71392b4a28564bfc1c795